Copyright 2026 The ai-cad-labs project

This product includes software developed by Saifuddin Raja and the AI-CAD Labs contributors and maintainers.

This product includes design runs produced by the AI-CAD system
(https://github.com/ai-cad-labs/ai-cad), an open-source AI-CAD engineering
department in which LLM agents generate, evaluate, and iteratively refine
parametric CAD (CadQuery) designs through visual and deterministic feedback loops.

The example projects in this repository are the verbatim outputs of real
autonomous design runs across two harness generations (the legacy PydanticAI
harness and the current Claude Code harness). They are provided as-is for
illustration and research; the geometry, narrative documents, and execution
logs were generated by the system, not hand-authored.

CadQuery (https://github.com/CadQuery/cadquery) is used by the AI-CAD system
to construct geometry and is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
